）<br>＝（x＋1）（2x＋b）","k":["90年第一次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800024","s":"如圖，已知在△ABC　中，∠ACB＝90°且<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r133.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＞<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r134.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">。求作：一圓與<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r135.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r136.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">相切，且圓心　O　在<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r137.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">上。下列四個取得圓心　O　的作圖方法，何者正確？【90　年第　1　次基測】<br><img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_image24.png\" width=\"110\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["取<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r139.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">中點為　O","作<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r140.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">中垂線交<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r141.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">於　O","作<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r142.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">中垂線交<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r143.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">於　O","作∠ACB　平分線交<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r144.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">於　O"],"a":3,"e":"如圖，若圓　O　與　<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r145.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r146.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">　分別相切於　E、D，則　<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r147.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r148.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">，即　O　點到　<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r149.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r150.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">　的距離相等<br>故　O　點必在　<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r151.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">　與　<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r152.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">　的夾角∠ACB　的平分線上<br><img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_image25.png\" width=\"108\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["90年第一次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800025","s":"如圖，已知　ABCD　是正方形，A　在　L　上，<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r154.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">⊥L，<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r155.svg\" width=\"24\" alt=\"附圖\">⊥L，垂足分別為　E、F（<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r156.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r157.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\"><img src=\"img/3cbca4