=\"附圖\">","<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r196.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r197.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">","△PQH<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r198.svg\" width=\"15\" alt=\"附圖\">△PRH"],"a":0,"e":"<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r199.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">　為△PQR　的對稱軸<br>∴△PQH<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r200.svg\" width=\"19\" alt=\"附圖\">△PRH，<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r201.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r202.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">，<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r203.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">⊥<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r204.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>又　M　為　<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r205.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\">　中點<br>∴<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r206.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">　為△PQR　的中點連線　<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r207.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">　<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r208.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">　//　<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r209.svg\" width=\"25\" alt=\"附圖\"><br>且　M　為△PHQ　的外心　<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r210.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">　<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r211.svg\" width=\"28\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r212.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r213.svg\" width=\"31\" alt=\"附圖\">","k":["90年第一次基測"],"d":"中","html":1},{"id":"05800030","s":"如圖，<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r214.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">、<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r215.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">為圓　O　的兩條直線，若∠ACD＝2∠AOC，且圓　O　的半徑為　30　公分，則∠BOC　所對的弧長是多少公分？<br><img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_image36.png\" width=\"108\" alt=\"附圖\">","o":["10π","12π","20π","24π"],"a":3,"e":"設∠AOC＝x°，則∠ACD＝2∠AOC＝2x°<br>∵<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r217.svg\" width=\"29\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r218.svg\" width=\"27\" alt=\"附圖\">　∴∠CAO＝∠ACO＝2x°<br>在△AOC　中，內角和＝2x°＋2x°＋x°＝180°　∴x＝36<br>故∠AOC＝36°　<img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r219.svg\" width=\"20\" alt=\"附圖\">　∠BOC＝180°－36°＝144°<br><img src=\"img/3cbca4_y90-1_r220.svg\" width=\"21\" alt=\"附圖\">＝<img src=\"im